==== Interfaces ====
The default network configuration after a openwrt CC factory image flash is:
^ Interface Name   ^ Description   ^ Default configuration   ^
| br-lan           | LAN & WLAN    | 192.168.1.1/24          |
| eth0             | WAN           | DHCP                    |
| eth1             | LAN           | None                    |
| radio0           | None          | Disabled                |

==== Switch ====
The device uses the AR9331's builtin switch for CPU's LAN port (eth1). The CPU's WAN port eth0 goes directly to the WAN port on the board. More information about the switch, the PHY and the connection/management options can be found in the [[https://www.openhacks.com/uploadsproductos/ar9331_datasheet.pdf|AR9331 datasheet section 2.9]].
<code>
  +--------------------------------+-x-x-x-x-x-+--+
  |  +-----------+  +-----------+  |    PHY    |  |
  |  |  CPU      |  |  Switch   |  |           |  |
  |  |      MDIO +--+           |  +-x-x-x-x-x-+  |
  |  |           |  | 0 1 2 3 4 |    |       |    |  
  |  |           |  +-x-x-x-x-x-+    |       |    |
  |  |           |    | |            |       |    |
  |  |  GE1/eth1 x----+ +----LAN-----+       |    |       
  |  |  GE0/eth0 x-----------WAN-------------+    |
  |  |           |                                |
  |  +-----------+                         AR9331 |
  +-----------------------------------------------+  
</code>
